  "notes": "External open-weight baseline pilot via OpenRouter (PROPOSED, not approved): Gemma 4 31B IT (Google, Apache-2.0). Track A's production v4 P1 request, byte-identical to C1a's, plus OpenRouter routing only (pinned providers, no fallback, data_collection deny, require_parameters); 25 dev clips x 2 repeats = 50 runs, C1a's seed. Needs an OpenRouter account and key (OPENROUTER_API_KEY), a prepaid balance (calls fail with 402 when it runs out, so exposure is the top-up), probes first, then a signed marker. Caps: 65 attempts, 1.5 M tokens. Judge cap 0.",
